    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Meningococcal contacts, one of: RIF 600 mg (kids > 1 mo 10 mg/kg; < 1 mo 5 mg/kg) PO q12h × 4 doses; ceftriaxone 250 mg (kids < 15 yrs 125 mg) IM × 1; adults: a FQ (cipro or levofloxacin 500 mg, or ofloxacin 400 mg) PO × 1."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
